<includeonly>{{#invoke:Kit|tabs}}</includeonly><noinclude>
Content split into tabs (up to 10). Without JavaScript the tabs show one after another.

<pre>
{{Tabs
|tab1=Overview|content1=Text for the first tab.
|tab2=Drops|content2=* Bone
* Ash
}}
</pre>

Tabs 5 to 10 work the same way (<code>tab5</code>, <code>content5</code> ...).

'''Result:'''

{{Tabs
